<title>USA: Regal Cinemas Inc Q1 net higher.</title>
<headline>Regal Cinemas Inc Q1 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>KNOXVILLE, Tenn. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							Apr 3,	Mar 28,</p>
<p>							  1997	  1996</p>
<p> Total revenues			  $77,445,000  $55,063,000</p>
<p> Net income app to common stock	8,536,000    4,634,000(1)</p>
<p> Earnings per share (2)			 0.25	   0.16(1)</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs outstanding (2)	 34,363,000    29,013,000</p>
<p>(1) Includes nonrecurring expenses of $161,000 after tax, or $0.01  per share, related to mergers.</p>
<p>(2) Adjusted to reflect the three-for-two stock split effected in September 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
